1
00:01:19,799 --> 00:01:21,920
[Simple yet elegant attire,]

2
00:01:22,319 --> 00:01:23,319
[delicate fingers,]

3
00:01:23,319 --> 00:01:24,560
[not a laborer.]

4
00:01:28,439 --> 00:01:30,319
[Young but composed,]

5
00:01:31,359 --> 00:01:34,159
[either a young master or a swindler.]

6
00:01:35,280 --> 00:01:36,959
Young master, do you know me?

7
00:01:37,120 --> 00:01:38,760
Coincidentally, just met.

8
00:01:39,359 --> 00:01:40,920
That's your "recruiting a son-in-law" notice, right?

9
00:01:41,280 --> 00:01:42,599
Are you willing to marry into my family?

10
00:01:42,599 --> 00:01:43,120
Yes.

11
00:01:43,120 --> 00:01:44,120
How much bride price do you want?

12
00:01:44,120 --> 00:01:45,040
Nothing.

13
00:01:45,079 --> 00:01:46,680
You can bring your own.

14
00:01:46,680 --> 00:01:47,319
Any conditions?

15
00:01:47,319 --> 00:01:48,519
Get married within ten days.

16
00:01:48,560 --> 00:01:50,519
[What a liar.]

17
00:01:51,359 --> 00:01:53,200
Oh, that's too bad.

18
00:01:53,200 --> 00:01:54,200
My parents

19
00:01:54,200 --> 00:01:55,319
are on a mission.

20
00:01:56,079 --> 00:01:57,920
They won't be back for a month.

21
00:01:58,159 --> 00:01:59,519
It seems you'll have to

22
00:01:59,519 --> 00:02:00,519
look elsewhere for a match.

23
00:02:00,959 --> 00:02:01,640
Farewell.

24
00:02:03,480 --> 00:02:04,280
Ah,

25
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:08,280
if your parents knew you were using them

26
00:02:08,280 --> 00:02:09,080
as an excuse to avoid marriage,

27
00:02:09,080 --> 00:02:09,840
they'd surely

28
00:02:10,039 --> 00:02:10,879
be pleased.

29
00:02:11,240 --> 00:02:12,719
That's avoiding disaster, okay?

30
00:02:12,719 --> 00:02:13,840
If they're watching from above,

31
00:02:13,840 --> 00:02:15,159
they wouldn't want me to be tricked.

32
00:02:15,360 --> 00:02:18,120
Besides, how can a perfect guy fall from the sky?

33
00:02:19,439 --> 00:02:20,039
Forget it.

34
00:02:20,039 --> 00:02:22,680
I'll go to the Matchmaker Pavilion.

35
00:02:25,280 --> 00:02:25,879
Let's go.

36
00:02:33,080 --> 00:02:35,039
Is it always this hard

37
00:02:35,039 --> 00:02:35,840
to marry into a family with my own dowry?

38
00:02:47,479 --> 00:02:48,520
You finally came.

39
00:02:49,080 --> 00:02:51,240
You are?

40
00:02:51,240 --> 00:02:52,680
I run the Matchmaker Pavilion.

41
00:02:52,680 --> 00:02:53,840
I've been waiting for you.

42
00:02:53,840 --> 00:02:54,439
Come in.

43
00:03:19,080 --> 00:03:19,879
Su Yuejiao,

44
00:03:20,439 --> 00:03:21,599
an escort from Su's Escort Agency,

45
00:03:21,599 --> 00:03:23,080
is looking for a husband.

46
00:03:23,560 --> 00:03:24,240
She is young

47
00:03:24,240 --> 00:03:26,120
but has a strong desire to get married.

48
00:03:26,120 --> 00:03:27,080
The reason is unknown.

49
00:03:27,400 --> 00:03:29,919
Because of her identity and rumors,

50
00:03:29,919 --> 00:03:30,719
she is suspected of

51
00:03:30,719 --> 00:03:31,680
domestic violence.

52
00:03:33,000 --> 00:03:34,120
Currently, no one in Yunjing City

53
00:03:34,120 --> 00:03:35,360
is interested in her.

54
00:03:37,000 --> 00:03:38,360
I feel offended.

55
00:03:38,360 --> 00:03:38,960
Miss,

56
00:03:38,960 --> 00:03:40,439
would you like to say it again?

57
00:03:41,159 --> 00:03:42,960
I value efficiency.

58
00:03:43,400 --> 00:03:44,599
The right medicine can work wonders.

59
00:03:44,800 --> 00:03:46,199
Just tell me what you need.

60
00:03:46,319 --> 00:03:47,120
Oh, right.

61
00:03:47,199 --> 00:03:48,520
Recruiting a son-in-law is more expensive than getting married.

62
00:03:48,719 --> 00:03:49,560
If you accept, just come.

63
00:03:50,800 --> 00:03:53,039
The best age is about my age,

64
00:03:53,039 --> 00:03:54,240
no more than 30 years old.

65
00:03:55,240 --> 00:03:56,159
Do you accept children?

66
00:03:57,840 --> 00:03:59,520
Single or widower without children.

67
00:04:00,080 --> 00:04:02,560
It's better to know some kong fu.

68
00:04:02,680 --> 00:04:03,919
No serious disability.

69
00:04:04,560 --> 00:04:06,319
I'll take over the Escort Agency in the future.

70
00:04:06,319 --> 00:04:08,080
If he knows how to manage a family,

71
00:04:08,159 --> 00:04:09,280
he may be helpful.

72
00:04:10,000 --> 00:04:10,800
He should be literate.

73
00:04:11,280 --> 00:04:13,639
It's better to get married within a month.

74
00:04:14,960 --> 00:04:16,040
Why a month?

75
00:04:16,639 --> 00:04:18,279
Is someone in your family ill?

76
00:04:18,279 --> 00:04:19,160
Or...

77
00:04:19,199 --> 00:04:20,160
No, no, no.

78
00:04:20,160 --> 00:04:20,959
Nothing like that.

79
00:04:20,959 --> 00:04:22,800
I just want to get things settled quickly.

80
00:04:23,600 --> 00:04:24,560
Are you open to blind dates?

81
00:04:26,399 --> 00:04:27,199
Blind dates?

82
00:04:35,600 --> 00:04:36,959
Yunjing City is so lively,

83
00:04:36,959 --> 00:04:39,079
much more than Ning'an County.

84
00:04:40,199 --> 00:04:42,319
I don't know when I'll be here next.

85
00:04:43,879 --> 00:04:44,920
Don't be so pessimistic.

86
00:04:45,720 --> 00:04:46,879
In half a month,

87
00:04:46,879 --> 00:04:49,839
we'll be living in this city.

88
00:04:49,959 --> 00:04:51,240
Master wouldn't let you move here.

89
00:04:51,240 --> 00:04:53,000
He didn't agree this time either,

90
00:04:53,000 --> 00:04:54,639
but I'm here anyway.

91
00:04:54,759 --> 00:04:55,759
So,

92
00:04:55,759 --> 00:04:57,079
do you like this city?

93
00:04:57,279 --> 00:04:58,040
Yeah.

94
00:04:58,480 --> 00:04:59,759
Do you want to stay here?

95
00:04:59,959 --> 00:05:00,759
Yeah.

96
00:05:01,399 --> 00:05:02,360
That's good.

97
00:05:02,839 --> 00:05:05,920
After I win the Nebula Assembly

98
00:05:05,920 --> 00:05:07,399
and become famous in the Yun State,

99
00:05:07,680 --> 00:05:10,600
I'll show you around here.

100
00:05:10,680 --> 00:05:11,519
Okay.

101
00:05:12,360 --> 00:05:14,199
Let's go shopping.

102
00:05:17,399 --> 00:05:19,000
Come on.

103
00:05:27,639 --> 00:05:28,879
Yicheng, hurry up.

104
00:05:32,879 --> 00:05:33,600
Here you are.

105
00:05:34,319 --> 00:05:35,600
Sugar-coated haws.

106
00:05:36,240 --> 00:05:37,560
I want one.

107
00:05:38,040 --> 00:05:38,720
Thanks.

108
00:05:40,480 --> 00:05:40,920
See?

109
00:05:50,319 --> 00:05:50,800
Clothes

110
00:05:51,240 --> 00:05:53,040
make the man.

111
00:05:53,160 --> 00:05:54,360
I look presentable now, right?

112
00:05:54,399 --> 00:05:56,079
Young Master, you should go back.

113
00:05:56,079 --> 00:05:57,560
Oh, right.

114
00:05:57,759 --> 00:05:58,759
It's about time.

115
00:05:58,759 --> 00:05:59,759
Prepare a carriage.

116
00:05:59,759 --> 00:06:01,240
Go back to Ning'an?

117
00:06:01,279 --> 00:06:02,360
No,

118
00:06:02,360 --> 00:06:03,879
to the Matchmaker Pavilion.

119
00:06:03,879 --> 00:06:04,759
I'm off.

120
00:06:13,920 --> 00:06:15,879
Welcome, Mr. Fu.

121
00:06:17,199 --> 00:06:17,959
Excuse me,

122
00:06:18,279 --> 00:06:21,079
is the young lady here?

123
00:06:21,240 --> 00:06:24,120
You come here every day.

124
00:06:24,240 --> 00:06:25,920
Your persistence

125
00:06:25,920 --> 00:06:27,600
will pay off.

126
00:06:28,399 --> 00:06:29,439
She's here today.

127
00:06:30,000 --> 00:06:30,759
Oh.

128
00:06:37,720 --> 00:06:39,879
Tang Xin, is this what people wear?

129
00:06:39,879 --> 00:06:41,040
It's so uncomfortable.

130
00:06:41,160 --> 00:06:42,839
I can't even throw a punch in it.

131
00:06:43,879 --> 00:06:44,680
Hey.

132
00:06:46,279 --> 00:06:47,079
Hey.

133
00:06:48,360 --> 00:06:49,399
I like it.

134
00:06:50,040 --> 00:06:51,240
What do you like?

135
00:06:51,240 --> 00:06:52,120
This is the wedding invitation.

136
00:06:53,480 --> 00:06:54,399
Pick any lucky day

137
00:06:54,399 --> 00:06:55,680
on it.

138
00:06:58,600 --> 00:06:59,879
You look strong.

139
00:06:59,879 --> 00:07:01,639
I think you can have five sons.

140
00:07:03,560 --> 00:07:04,759
I've already picked out names for them,

141
00:07:06,319 --> 00:07:07,680
they're all on this piece of paper.

142
00:07:10,439 --> 00:07:13,079
Hey, I barely said anything,

143
00:07:13,160 --> 00:07:15,240
and you've already decided on the number of sons.

144
00:07:16,839 --> 00:07:17,920
With his physique,

145
00:07:18,000 --> 00:07:19,040
he can easily have ten.

146
00:07:26,399 --> 00:07:28,680
Miss, Fu Xiang from the Fuyun Escort Agency wishes to see you.

147
00:07:29,839 --> 00:07:31,680
Isn't he my father's errand boy?

148
00:07:32,120 --> 00:07:33,199
What does he want with me?

149
00:07:33,879 --> 00:07:34,759
I don't know.

150
00:07:35,120 --> 00:07:38,279
Shopkeeper Li said he came here for you several times.

151
00:07:38,279 --> 00:07:39,079
I don't want to see him.

152
00:07:39,680 --> 00:07:40,480
Yes.

153
00:07:41,120 --> 00:07:41,920
Wait.

154
00:07:45,879 --> 00:07:46,920
Let him in.

155
00:07:47,199 --> 00:07:47,839
OK.

156
00:08:00,839 --> 00:08:02,360
What can I do for you?

157
00:08:04,720 --> 00:08:05,519
Miss Zhang,

158
00:08:06,120 --> 00:08:06,959
over the years,

159
00:08:07,279 --> 00:08:10,920
our Fuyun Escort Agency has been serving the Grand Tutor,

160
00:08:11,079 --> 00:08:12,480
without a hitch.

161
00:08:13,199 --> 00:08:14,319
We've always wanted

162
00:08:14,720 --> 00:08:17,720
to help with your business.

163
00:08:17,720 --> 00:08:19,199
That would be great.

164
00:08:21,720 --> 00:08:22,319
Miss,

165
00:08:22,319 --> 00:08:24,319
just rest assured,

166
00:08:24,319 --> 00:08:25,720
as long as it's your request,

167
00:08:25,720 --> 00:08:28,800
we'll treat it as our top priority.

168
00:08:28,800 --> 00:08:29,560
Get to the point.

169
00:08:31,519 --> 00:08:32,919
Nebula Assembly.

170
00:08:33,000 --> 00:08:35,159
Can Fuyun Escort Agency

171
00:08:35,399 --> 00:08:38,039
take charge of the Nebula Assembly?

172
00:08:39,679 --> 00:08:41,919
It's just a gathering of literati.

173
00:08:41,919 --> 00:08:43,679
No need for guards.

174
00:08:45,120 --> 00:08:47,240
I may be rough,

175
00:08:47,240 --> 00:08:48,480
but I understand

176
00:08:48,679 --> 00:08:51,559
this is the Grand Tutor's idea.

177
00:08:51,840 --> 00:08:53,960
I just wanna repay you

178
00:08:54,200 --> 00:08:57,440
for your years of support,

179
00:08:59,159 --> 00:09:01,360
and meet some influential people

180
00:09:02,799 --> 00:09:04,519
to boost business.

181
00:09:06,399 --> 00:09:08,639
You're so smart.

182
00:09:08,919 --> 00:09:09,960
I see.

183
00:09:12,080 --> 00:09:12,879
So...

184
00:09:17,360 --> 00:09:18,320
Well...

185
00:09:18,320 --> 00:09:20,720
You can think about my suggestion.

186
00:09:20,879 --> 00:09:22,159
If you need,

187
00:09:22,279 --> 00:09:25,679
Fuyun Agency will do anything for you.

188
00:09:26,399 --> 00:09:27,559
Mr. Fu,

189
00:09:28,200 --> 00:09:29,159
please.

190
00:09:33,039 --> 00:09:33,960
Don't bother to see me off.

191
00:09:39,639 --> 00:09:40,440
Humph.

192
00:09:40,799 --> 00:09:42,240
What a jerk.

193
00:09:42,960 --> 00:09:45,679
You don't need to escort goods anymore.

194
00:09:46,200 --> 00:09:48,399
You should take care of me and educate the children.

195
00:09:49,200 --> 00:09:50,840
Don't ask.

196
00:09:51,399 --> 00:09:52,679
I'll support you.

197
00:09:57,679 --> 00:09:59,679
I'm also going to take three concubines.

198
00:10:00,559 --> 00:10:02,480
And you should respect my parents.

199
00:10:02,960 --> 00:10:03,759
Well.

200
00:10:03,919 --> 00:10:05,360
Three is too few.

201
00:10:06,799 --> 00:10:08,600
A hero like you

202
00:10:08,759 --> 00:10:11,320
should have at least ten.

203
00:10:11,360 --> 00:10:12,600
Yeah.

204
00:10:14,240 --> 00:10:16,120
If you have a suitable one,

205
00:10:16,440 --> 00:10:17,679
you can introduce her to me.

206
00:10:18,559 --> 00:10:21,039
This man is really straightforward

207
00:10:21,559 --> 00:10:22,600
and frank.

208
00:10:23,080 --> 00:10:25,559
But the information from the Matchmaker Pavilion

209
00:10:25,559 --> 00:10:27,840
is totally different.

210
00:10:30,519 --> 00:10:32,759
You saw through me so quickly.

211
00:10:32,879 --> 00:10:35,360
See?

212
00:10:35,559 --> 00:10:37,799
Yeah, my wife

213
00:10:37,879 --> 00:10:40,559
is the only one who knows the real me.

214
00:10:42,399 --> 00:10:42,879
Ouch!

215
00:10:42,879 --> 00:10:43,679
Ouch!

216
00:10:43,840 --> 00:10:47,240
You offended it.

217
00:10:50,000 --> 00:10:51,039
Sir,

218
00:10:51,039 --> 00:10:52,519
how can I get to Su's Escort Agency?

219
00:10:52,759 --> 00:10:53,720
You're an escort?

220
00:10:53,720 --> 00:10:55,279
This road,

221
00:10:55,279 --> 00:10:56,480
go straight to the end.

222
00:10:56,639 --> 00:10:57,440
Thank you.

223
00:10:57,840 --> 00:11:01,679
Now it doesn't listen to me.

224
00:11:02,120 --> 00:11:03,399
What are you waiting for?

225
00:11:03,600 --> 00:11:05,159
Teach her a lesson!

226
00:11:11,039 --> 00:11:12,000
You are the kind of person

227
00:11:12,120 --> 00:11:13,600
who should be left to your wives.

228
00:11:13,639 --> 00:11:15,080
If you want to be related to me,

229
00:11:15,080 --> 00:11:15,879
no way.

230
00:11:16,840 --> 00:11:17,879
Come on!

231
00:11:38,799 --> 00:11:39,679
Why are you again?

232
00:11:43,279 --> 00:11:44,960
You want to be a hero to save a beauty.

233
00:11:45,000 --> 00:11:46,200
Pretending to meet by chance.

234
00:11:49,320 --> 00:11:50,480
We must be fated to meet.

235
00:11:50,480 --> 00:11:52,639
I was just about to look for you.

236
00:11:53,120 --> 00:11:54,720
I'm just an escort,

237
00:11:54,720 --> 00:11:55,960
not much money to scam.

238
00:11:55,960 --> 00:11:57,080
Find someone else.

239
00:11:57,080 --> 00:11:58,200
Scam money?

240
00:11:59,960 --> 00:12:02,240
I think there must be some misunderstanding.

241
00:12:04,720 --> 00:12:07,200
I didn't expect you to be so bad-tempered,

242
00:12:07,440 --> 00:12:08,879
and not behave as a woman should.

243
00:12:09,159 --> 00:12:11,480
You flirt with this pretty boy.

244
00:12:11,720 --> 00:12:12,840
Teach her a lesson!

245
00:12:12,840 --> 00:12:13,799
What are you talking about?

246
00:12:14,120 --> 00:12:16,600
You've read the post, so you're mine.

247
00:12:17,519 --> 00:12:18,840
This is Yunjing City.

248
00:12:18,879 --> 00:12:20,240
Don't be so rude.

249
00:12:22,320 --> 00:12:23,279
My family arranged this.

250
00:12:23,840 --> 00:12:24,639
We just met.

251
00:12:24,679 --> 00:12:25,440
First time.

252
00:12:25,440 --> 00:12:26,360
I don't like her.

253
00:12:26,720 --> 00:12:27,720
What do you think?

254
00:12:29,919 --> 00:12:33,799
Wow, this guy is marrying Su Yuejiao.

255
00:12:33,879 --> 00:12:36,360
That's like saving her from a burning building.

256
00:12:36,360 --> 00:12:40,600
Who in Yunjing City would want her?

257
00:12:41,679 --> 00:12:42,240
Bro,

258
00:12:42,240 --> 00:12:43,159
you're a living saint.

259
00:12:45,480 --> 00:12:48,519
Did you hear that? Marrying you is your lucky day.

260
00:12:49,639 --> 00:12:53,240
Fu Xiang, you big man, always so sarcastic.

261
00:12:53,240 --> 00:12:55,000
Got the guts to fight me?

262
00:12:55,000 --> 00:12:57,559
Hey, I'm in a bad mood today.

263
00:12:58,279 --> 00:13:00,879
I'll teach you a lesson for my bro.

264
00:13:00,879 --> 00:13:03,120
Let you know what a real man is.

265
00:13:05,360 --> 00:13:06,840
Marriage

266
00:13:06,840 --> 00:13:08,799
should be based on mutual consent.

267
00:13:09,039 --> 00:13:10,960
How can you force someone to marry you?

268
00:13:11,240 --> 00:13:13,600
Who are you? It's none of your business.

269
00:13:13,600 --> 00:13:14,759
So rude.

270
00:13:14,759 --> 00:13:16,759
Yun State is a country of etiquette.

271
00:13:17,480 --> 00:13:19,639
It's everyone's responsibility to follow the rules.

272
00:13:19,960 --> 00:13:22,879
This guy is really rude.

273
00:13:27,840 --> 00:13:30,919
How dare you meddle with such a small body.

274
00:13:32,879 --> 00:13:35,039
I'll shut you up first.

275
00:13:36,639 --> 00:13:37,440
Beat him.

276
00:13:54,720 --> 00:13:55,519
Brother

277
00:13:56,000 --> 00:13:58,720
Do you think the boss wants to get married or not?

278
00:13:59,360 --> 00:14:01,000
Anyway, no one is worthy of my sister.

279
00:14:01,879 --> 00:14:03,399
Something happened.

280
00:14:03,720 --> 00:14:04,279
Brother.

281
00:14:04,440 --> 00:14:04,960
Faca.

282
00:14:05,720 --> 00:14:07,080
The boss is fighting with someone.

283
00:14:07,120 --> 00:14:07,679
Where?

284
00:14:07,679 --> 00:14:08,320
Who is she fighting with?

285
00:14:08,519 --> 00:14:09,440
Fu Xiang and his men.

286
00:14:19,279 --> 00:14:20,679
What happened up front?

287
00:14:20,879 --> 00:14:22,639
Miss, it's Fu Xiang.

288
00:14:23,080 --> 00:14:23,879
And someone else

289
00:14:24,200 --> 00:14:25,679
started a fight with Su Yuejiao.

290
00:14:26,639 --> 00:14:27,600
Su Yuejiao?

291
00:14:28,799 --> 00:14:29,960
From Su's Escort Agency?

292
00:14:30,320 --> 00:14:30,919
That's right.

293
00:14:32,320 --> 00:14:34,080
She was just matchmaking upstairs.

294
00:14:34,559 --> 00:14:35,360
She flew down.

295
00:14:35,960 --> 00:14:37,039
Quick, drive them away.

296
00:14:37,200 --> 00:14:38,519
They're blocking the way.

297
00:14:38,679 --> 00:14:39,519
No need.

298
00:14:39,879 --> 00:14:41,200
If anything's damaged inside,

299
00:14:41,600 --> 00:14:42,559
make sure someone pays for it.

300
00:14:42,840 --> 00:14:43,639
Yes, Miss.

301
00:14:43,759 --> 00:14:45,039
Take the back carriage.

302
00:14:46,720 --> 00:14:48,759
Su Yuejiao, you're indeed fierce.

303
00:14:48,759 --> 00:14:49,559
No one will want you.

304
00:14:49,679 --> 00:14:52,759
I think you'll never get married.

305
00:14:53,559 --> 00:14:56,399
I think your life will end today.

306
00:14:56,440 --> 00:14:58,080
You're quite bold, aren't you?

307
00:14:58,120 --> 00:14:59,679
I didn't expect you to be good at talking

308
00:14:59,799 --> 00:15:01,159
but not at martial arts.

309
00:15:01,600 --> 00:15:03,519
You men bully a girl.

310
00:15:03,720 --> 00:15:06,039
That's the best of the people in Yunjing City.

311
00:15:06,039 --> 00:15:06,559
Yeah.

312
00:15:06,559 --> 00:15:07,919
How can these men

313
00:15:07,919 --> 00:15:08,759
bully her?

314
00:15:09,120 --> 00:15:09,960
Isn't that the young lady of the Su Family?

315
00:15:09,960 --> 00:15:10,879
How can she do that?

316
00:15:10,879 --> 00:15:11,879
Maybe they were beaten by the girl.

317
00:15:11,879 --> 00:15:13,039
You shut up.

318
00:15:13,080 --> 00:15:14,360
You pretty boy.

319
00:15:14,600 --> 00:15:16,200
I'll teach you a lesson today.

320
00:15:16,480 --> 00:15:18,519
You big guy only pick on the weak.

321
00:15:18,519 --> 00:15:21,360
You have no guts. Come and fight me.

322
00:15:21,360 --> 00:15:22,159
Hey.

323
00:15:22,960 --> 00:15:24,120
I can see that

324
00:15:24,200 --> 00:15:26,919
this girl is bullying you guys.

325
00:15:27,519 --> 00:15:30,240
I just saw the official carriage passing by.

326
00:15:30,240 --> 00:15:31,440
I'll report it to the government for you.

327
00:15:32,080 --> 00:15:33,679
I can't go to the government again.

328
00:15:33,840 --> 00:15:35,279
I'll be killed by my father.

329
00:15:36,200 --> 00:15:37,000
Let's go.

330
00:15:42,039 --> 00:15:43,399
This gentleman

331
00:15:43,399 --> 00:15:45,679
must be an escort, too.

332
00:15:46,120 --> 00:15:47,600
You look extraordinary.

333
00:15:48,039 --> 00:15:50,120
You are different from those guys.

334
00:15:50,399 --> 00:15:52,039
Are you afraid?

335
00:15:52,080 --> 00:15:53,360
I'm not afraid of you.

336
00:15:53,720 --> 00:15:55,639
You flatter others.

337
00:15:55,720 --> 00:15:57,960
Don't you know your own ability?

338
00:15:58,759 --> 00:15:59,559
Su Yuejiao,

339
00:16:00,320 --> 00:16:02,159
do you want to stay in Yunjing?

340
00:16:02,159 --> 00:16:03,879
I'll beat you.

341
00:16:04,279 --> 00:16:05,080
Come on.

342
00:16:05,799 --> 00:16:06,360
Move aside.

343
00:16:06,360 --> 00:16:06,919
My Lord.

344
00:16:06,919 --> 00:16:08,279
My Lord, are you okay?

345
00:16:08,440 --> 00:16:10,279
My Lord, are you okay?

346
00:16:10,559 --> 00:16:12,000
Fu Xiang, what did you do?

347
00:16:14,320 --> 00:16:15,639
Sister, take a break.

348
00:16:15,879 --> 00:16:16,840
I'll beat him for you.

349
00:16:19,039 --> 00:16:20,039
Move aside.

350
00:16:20,120 --> 00:16:20,679
Move aside.

351
00:16:20,679 --> 00:16:23,639
Just let him go like this?

352
00:16:23,720 --> 00:16:25,399
What happened to your bullying?

353
00:16:25,399 --> 00:16:27,440
I didn't expect that Fuyun Agency

354
00:16:27,440 --> 00:16:28,480
would run away from a fight.

355
00:16:28,559 --> 00:16:30,399
Isn't that the escort's habit?

356
00:16:30,399 --> 00:16:33,120
We Su's Agency is not like that.

357
00:16:37,759 --> 00:16:39,039
What did you do

358
00:16:39,039 --> 00:16:39,639
to my sister?

359
00:16:39,639 --> 00:16:40,399
Brother.

360
00:16:40,399 --> 00:16:41,200
Nothing.

361
00:16:41,240 --> 00:16:43,039
This young master just stood up for me.

362
00:16:46,559 --> 00:16:48,279
You may not be skilled in martial arts,

363
00:16:48,399 --> 00:16:49,600
but you're quite honorable.

364
00:16:49,799 --> 00:16:50,320
Thanks.

365
00:16:50,639 --> 00:16:52,200
Just doing my part.

366
00:16:53,200 --> 00:16:54,240
As a token of gratitude,

367
00:16:54,320 --> 00:16:55,279
I'll share a secret with you.

368
00:16:55,519 --> 00:16:57,120
If you're serious about marriage,

369
00:16:57,200 --> 00:16:58,440
avoid the Matchmaker Pavilion.

370
00:16:59,440 --> 00:17:00,080
Farewell.

371
00:17:00,480 --> 00:17:01,200
Farewell.

372
00:17:02,799 --> 00:17:03,600
Hmm.

373
00:17:15,160 --> 00:17:16,920
I feel better now.

374
00:17:18,480 --> 00:17:20,240
You were on a blind date, right?

375
00:17:20,240 --> 00:17:21,319
Why did you fight?

376
00:17:22,200 --> 00:17:23,319
Don't mention it.

377
00:17:23,480 --> 00:17:25,720
The Matchmaker Pavilion sent me such a guy.

378
00:17:25,880 --> 00:17:26,920
He was said to be well-educated

379
00:17:26,920 --> 00:17:27,839
and handsome.

380
00:17:28,039 --> 00:17:30,000
He's just a rude ruffian.

381
00:17:32,240 --> 00:17:33,240
No way.

382
00:17:33,240 --> 00:17:35,200
It's said that the Matchmaker Pavilion is very effective.

383
00:17:36,160 --> 00:17:37,119
And Fu Xiang

384
00:17:37,519 --> 00:17:39,240
came to challenge me for no reason.

385
00:17:39,519 --> 00:17:42,079
I'll beat him up in the arena.

386
00:17:43,079 --> 00:17:43,799
In the whole Yunjing,

387
00:17:43,799 --> 00:17:46,200
only your escort agency can compete with him.

388
00:17:46,519 --> 00:17:48,839
He's been giving you trouble for a long time.

389
00:17:50,039 --> 00:17:53,359
But it was that swindler,

390
00:17:53,359 --> 00:17:54,160
no,

391
00:17:54,160 --> 00:17:55,519
that young master,

392
00:17:55,519 --> 00:17:57,519
who was obviously weak,

393
00:17:57,799 --> 00:17:59,319
but stood up for me.

394
00:18:00,160 --> 00:18:01,319
Though both are men,

395
00:18:01,319 --> 00:18:02,759
they are not the same.

396
00:18:04,559 --> 00:18:06,880
Is it the handsome young master?

397
00:18:07,400 --> 00:18:08,200
Yes.

398
00:18:08,440 --> 00:18:11,400
The one who brought betrothal gifts to marry into your family?

399
00:18:11,599 --> 00:18:12,400
Yes.

400
00:18:12,720 --> 00:18:15,119
Then why don't you just marry him?

401
00:18:17,319 --> 00:18:18,160
Yeah.

402
00:18:18,839 --> 00:18:21,240
I can't deal with you.

403
00:18:21,759 --> 00:18:23,599
Who is that young master?

404
00:18:25,200 --> 00:18:26,000
I don't know.

405
00:18:27,759 --> 00:18:28,799
What's his name?

406
00:18:30,079 --> 00:18:30,880
I don't know.

407
00:18:32,480 --> 00:18:33,680
Do you know who you are?

408
00:18:33,680 --> 00:18:35,279
I'm Su Yuejiao.

409
00:18:36,480 --> 00:18:37,559
Forget it.

410
00:18:38,400 --> 00:18:39,640
It means we are not meant to be.

411
00:18:41,279 --> 00:18:42,559
I should go to the Matchmaker Pavilion.

412
00:18:42,720 --> 00:18:43,839
It doesn't work. Why do you go there?

413
00:18:43,839 --> 00:18:45,400
I have to make this swindler

414
00:18:46,400 --> 00:18:47,400
close the shop.

415
00:18:50,000 --> 00:18:51,440
That's called closing the business.

416
00:18:59,599 --> 00:19:00,880
Wow.

417
00:19:00,880 --> 00:19:01,880
People from Yunjing

418
00:19:01,880 --> 00:19:03,079
get married in ten days,

419
00:19:03,119 --> 00:19:04,160
and return home at any time.

420
00:19:04,319 --> 00:19:04,920
That's all?

421
00:19:05,039 --> 00:19:05,839
That's all.

422
00:19:07,359 --> 00:19:08,920
One hundred taels of silver, please.

423
00:19:09,519 --> 00:19:10,640
Why is it so expensive?

424
00:19:11,839 --> 00:19:13,559
Your young master is worth this price.

425
00:19:14,000 --> 00:19:14,960
Or

426
00:19:14,960 --> 00:19:16,480
you can be mine.

427
00:19:21,359 --> 00:19:22,160
Ah.

428
00:19:23,359 --> 00:19:26,759
No wonder someone told me not to come here.

429
00:19:27,319 --> 00:19:30,559
I didn't expect you like this type.

430
00:19:30,559 --> 00:19:31,960
But you're here.

431
00:19:36,519 --> 00:19:37,720
He is strong

432
00:19:37,720 --> 00:19:38,759
and diligent.

433
00:19:38,759 --> 00:19:39,599
What's wrong with him?

434
00:19:40,720 --> 00:19:41,519
He...

435
00:19:45,119 --> 00:19:46,160
I have to take him away today.

436
00:19:46,720 --> 00:19:48,000
I don't have enough money with me.

437
00:19:48,000 --> 00:19:49,759
How about I give you 50 taels of silver first?

438
00:19:49,759 --> 00:19:50,720
Is that okay?

439
00:19:54,200 --> 00:19:54,720
Yicheng,

440
00:19:55,279 --> 00:19:55,920
give her the money.

441
00:20:02,160 --> 00:20:03,039
You're back.

442
00:20:03,599 --> 00:20:04,599
Meng Feifei,

443
00:20:04,599 --> 00:20:06,279
how dare you run a black shop?

444
00:20:07,599 --> 00:20:09,599
I can't take Chief Su's words.

445
00:20:10,079 --> 00:20:12,480
Guo Yongshi didn't deliver what he promised.

446
00:20:12,640 --> 00:20:13,880
He's a complete rascal.

447
00:20:14,200 --> 00:20:16,920
I suspect you're in cahoots with him.

448
00:20:17,200 --> 00:20:21,359
25 years old, unmarried, martial arts skills, literate,

449
00:20:23,440 --> 00:20:25,960
and capable of having five sons, right?

450
00:20:27,599 --> 00:20:31,039
Which of these does Guo Yongshi not meet?

451
00:20:31,319 --> 00:20:33,640
Moreover, I didn't even charge you.

452
00:20:33,839 --> 00:20:35,799
How can you call this a scam?

453
00:20:39,480 --> 00:20:41,400
Chief Su, you've been searching for a husband for a long time,

454
00:20:41,559 --> 00:20:43,839
but you don't know what you want.

455
00:20:44,400 --> 00:20:47,079
Now at least you know what you don't want.

456
00:20:47,720 --> 00:20:48,960
If you're willing to give it a try,

457
00:20:49,400 --> 00:20:50,640
you need to pay me 50 taels.

458
00:20:50,960 --> 00:20:52,279
How dare you ask for money?

459
00:20:53,240 --> 00:20:54,319
If it doesn't work,

460
00:20:54,359 --> 00:20:55,880
you can smash my Matchmaker Pavilion.

461
00:21:00,200 --> 00:21:01,480
You said that?

462
00:21:27,960 --> 00:21:28,839
Yes, Master.

463
00:21:30,680 --> 00:21:31,480
Boss.

464
00:21:32,880 --> 00:21:33,960
Ah.

465
00:21:35,079 --> 00:21:36,240
The future head of our escort agency

466
00:21:37,319 --> 00:21:40,440
who fought with others in the street is back.

467
00:21:41,119 --> 00:21:42,920
You're a girl.

468
00:21:43,039 --> 00:21:45,039
You're like a ruffian all day.

469
00:21:45,160 --> 00:21:45,680
Who will

470
00:21:45,680 --> 00:21:49,359
let their son marry into our family?

471
00:21:50,680 --> 00:21:53,359
Don't worry about my business.

472
00:21:54,759 --> 00:21:56,960
Shopkeeper Li of Huayue Tower just said

473
00:21:57,039 --> 00:21:59,400
you owed 80 taels of silver for wine this month.

474
00:22:00,519 --> 00:22:02,839
You insisted on taking short-distance escort.

475
00:22:03,000 --> 00:22:04,720
You're forgetful and perfunctory.

476
00:22:04,880 --> 00:22:06,440
You lose more money than you make.

477
00:22:08,240 --> 00:22:10,960
Who can't get married

478
00:22:11,559 --> 00:22:13,720
and ruined the agency's reputation?

479
00:22:14,000 --> 00:22:14,920
It's you.

480
00:22:14,920 --> 00:22:16,079
Su Yuejiao,

481
00:22:16,079 --> 00:22:17,160
even if you can't get married,

482
00:22:17,160 --> 00:22:18,200
I can run the agency.

483
00:22:18,319 --> 00:22:19,480
It's not your turn.

484
00:22:20,640 --> 00:22:21,279
Nonsense.

485
00:22:21,279 --> 00:22:22,400
Why not?

486
00:22:23,160 --> 00:22:24,680
The agency was founded by my mother.

487
00:22:24,720 --> 00:22:25,960
My sister was born before me.

488
00:22:25,960 --> 00:22:26,759
I accept it.

489
00:22:26,920 --> 00:22:29,759
But why can you inherit the Escort Agency?

490
00:22:31,359 --> 00:22:33,119
Just because you're a woman?

491
00:22:42,720 --> 00:22:44,519
If you're so capable, beat me.

492
00:22:44,519 --> 00:22:45,960
And stop talking nonsense.

493
00:22:46,039 --> 00:22:47,480
And I'm telling you,

494
00:22:47,480 --> 00:22:47,839
from now on,

495
00:22:47,839 --> 00:22:50,400
don't expect me to clean up your mess for you.

496
00:22:50,400 --> 00:22:51,200
Don't even dream about it.

497
00:22:52,960 --> 00:22:54,759
Dad, look at her.

498
00:22:54,759 --> 00:22:56,440
Oh my.

499
00:22:56,440 --> 00:22:57,000
Grandfather,

500
00:22:57,000 --> 00:22:58,599
I suddenly feel uncomfortable in my heart.

501
00:22:58,680 --> 00:22:59,480
Oh, Jiaojiao,

502
00:22:59,519 --> 00:23:01,079
quick, help me back to the room.

503
00:23:03,319 --> 00:23:05,599
I can't make it, oh no.

504
00:23:07,920 --> 00:23:09,160
The Escort Agency will be mine sooner or later.

505
00:23:09,279 --> 00:23:09,839
Humph.

506
00:23:10,200 --> 00:23:10,839
Slow down.

507
00:23:14,200 --> 00:23:17,119
Grandpa, are you okay now?

508
00:23:17,440 --> 00:23:18,640
Am I not okay?

509
00:23:19,839 --> 00:23:21,000
You're pretending to be sick again.

510
00:23:21,000 --> 00:23:22,000
Always protecting him.

511
00:23:22,000 --> 00:23:23,720
Oh, Zhen.

512
00:23:23,960 --> 00:23:26,279
You started this escort agency.

513
00:23:26,279 --> 00:23:27,920
Yu'er made it thrive.

514
00:23:28,359 --> 00:23:31,039
Then I lost him.

515
00:23:31,039 --> 00:23:32,359
It was devastating.

516
00:23:32,359 --> 00:23:34,839
Jiaojiao had to run it at a young age.

517
00:23:34,839 --> 00:23:37,000
Grandpa, I am Jiaojiao.

518
00:23:37,000 --> 00:23:37,960
It's not necessary.

519
00:23:37,960 --> 00:23:39,920
I've been running it for 18 years.

520
00:23:39,920 --> 00:23:41,240
I'm just 18 years old.

521
00:23:41,240 --> 00:23:42,480
At the age of marriage.

522
00:23:42,480 --> 00:23:44,279
She doesn't want to get married?

523
00:23:44,319 --> 00:23:45,559
It's not that I don't want to.

524
00:23:45,640 --> 00:23:46,000
It's...

525
00:23:46,000 --> 00:23:47,480
Alright, you can go now.

526
00:23:47,480 --> 00:23:48,480
I'm going to sleep.

527
00:23:48,599 --> 00:23:50,559
It's easy to get sleepy when it gets dark.

528
00:24:11,240 --> 00:24:12,240
Master.

529
00:24:13,559 --> 00:24:14,359
Master.

530
00:24:15,640 --> 00:24:16,559
I'm so mad.

531
00:24:18,200 --> 00:24:19,480
You finally come back.

532
00:24:19,759 --> 00:24:21,640
Why don't you just stay in Yunjing?

533
00:24:21,839 --> 00:24:22,839
Run out of money?

534
00:24:22,839 --> 00:24:24,400
Or get into trouble?

535
00:24:25,440 --> 00:24:29,000
They've come back safely.

536
00:24:29,160 --> 00:24:30,720
And have knelt for hours.

537
00:24:33,240 --> 00:24:35,119
Let them get up first.

538
00:24:38,920 --> 00:24:41,559
What did he do in Yunjing?

539
00:24:44,240 --> 00:24:45,400
Don't look at him.

540
00:24:46,839 --> 00:24:47,880
Let him speak.

541
00:24:53,599 --> 00:24:54,240
Master.

542
00:24:54,759 --> 00:24:56,000
He went to Yunjing

543
00:24:56,000 --> 00:24:57,359
to study in the academy.

544
00:24:57,880 --> 00:24:58,680
Study?

545
00:24:59,279 --> 00:25:00,119
Yes.

546
00:25:00,119 --> 00:25:01,359
What do you want to study?

547
00:25:01,519 --> 00:25:02,480
With your ability?

548
00:25:03,000 --> 00:25:05,680
I know I'm not cut out for martial arts.

549
00:25:05,680 --> 00:25:07,880
I want to study for the scholarly honor.

550
00:25:08,920 --> 00:25:11,400
I've got a bad record in Ning'an.

551
00:25:11,680 --> 00:25:14,079
I'm afraid I can't stay there.

552
00:25:14,079 --> 00:25:15,880
So I want to go to the academy in Yunjing.

553
00:25:15,880 --> 00:25:16,680
Yes.

554
00:25:16,759 --> 00:25:19,319
He bought a lot of things for study.

555
00:25:21,319 --> 00:25:23,440
You've been idling around,

556
00:25:24,039 --> 00:25:25,759
and now you want to take the exam?

557
00:25:27,599 --> 00:25:28,920
As long as I'm alive,

558
00:25:28,920 --> 00:25:31,119
the Cheng family will only produce warriors.

559
00:25:31,119 --> 00:25:32,920
You're not allowed to take the exam.

560
00:25:35,039 --> 00:25:35,839
Yes.

561
00:25:37,400 --> 00:25:40,119
I had a lot of feelings in Yunjing.

562
00:25:40,599 --> 00:25:42,920
So I came back to tell you.

563
00:25:43,200 --> 00:25:45,759
Really? Tell me,

564
00:25:45,960 --> 00:25:47,359
what feelings do you have?

565
00:25:48,839 --> 00:25:49,880
I want to get married.

566
00:25:55,559 --> 00:25:56,400
Stand up.

567
00:25:57,880 --> 00:25:59,160
Are you serious?

568
00:25:59,839 --> 00:26:02,200
A man should start a family first.

569
00:26:02,799 --> 00:26:03,640
For years,

570
00:26:03,920 --> 00:26:05,559
I've been waiting for this day.

571
00:26:05,920 --> 00:26:07,440
Finally, it's here.

572
00:26:07,440 --> 00:26:08,799
My dear,

573
00:26:09,079 --> 00:26:10,839
don't listen to his nonsense.

574
00:26:11,279 --> 00:26:12,640
Who would want to marry him?

575
00:26:12,640 --> 00:26:14,119
It's the daughter of the Yan family.

576
00:26:14,799 --> 00:26:16,039
I fell in love with her at first sight.

577
00:26:16,119 --> 00:26:18,519
The wedding date is set,

578
00:26:18,519 --> 00:26:19,720
ten days later.

579
00:26:20,119 --> 00:26:20,920
Look,

580
00:26:21,200 --> 00:26:22,519
here's Miss Yan's betrothal card.

581
00:26:25,720 --> 00:26:26,160
Fine,

582
00:26:26,759 --> 00:26:28,440
just give me 50 taels of silver.

583
00:26:32,480 --> 00:26:33,119
Miss,

584
00:26:33,119 --> 00:26:34,599
add 200 taels of silver

585
00:26:34,599 --> 00:26:35,640
to the betrothal gifts.

586
00:26:36,079 --> 00:26:37,839
Once you board the escort cart,

587
00:26:38,079 --> 00:26:40,440
the gifts will be delivered to your home.

588
00:26:40,839 --> 00:26:41,880
That's good.

589
00:26:42,400 --> 00:26:44,839
I'll be waiting for you.

590
00:26:44,839 --> 00:26:45,559
Honey,

591
00:26:55,839 --> 00:26:58,720
don't let that brat fool you again.

592
00:26:59,559 --> 00:27:02,039
Nonsense.

593
00:27:02,200 --> 00:27:04,400
Look, the betrothal card has been changed.

594
00:27:05,839 --> 00:27:07,079
You said yourself,

595
00:27:07,680 --> 00:27:10,240
who in Ning'an would marry him?

596
00:27:10,680 --> 00:27:11,960
If we miss this chance,

597
00:27:12,359 --> 00:27:14,400
when will we ever have a grandson?

598
00:27:15,759 --> 00:27:16,720
And

599
00:27:16,960 --> 00:27:17,880
Qi'er

600
00:27:18,119 --> 00:27:19,559
is not suitable for martial arts.

601
00:27:19,559 --> 00:27:21,119
But he has a chance to get married.

602
00:27:28,839 --> 00:27:32,400
For your slight progress this time,

603
00:27:33,039 --> 00:27:34,000
you can leave now.

604
00:27:34,720 --> 00:27:37,519
And get ready to marry Miss Yan.

605
00:27:41,000 --> 00:27:42,480
Yes.

606
00:27:57,359 --> 00:27:58,000
Yicheng,

607
00:27:58,359 --> 00:27:59,400
pack your luggage.

608
00:27:59,400 --> 00:28:00,519
We'll go to Yunjing.

609
00:28:00,720 --> 00:28:01,160
Okay.

610
00:28:01,359 --> 00:28:01,799
Let's go.

611
00:28:24,039 --> 00:28:24,839
Mom

612
00:28:26,480 --> 00:28:28,039
What should I do?

613
00:28:38,480 --> 00:28:39,279
A Jiao

614
00:28:40,720 --> 00:28:41,880
Get up and practice.

615
00:28:44,839 --> 00:28:45,799
If you don't get up,

616
00:28:45,799 --> 00:28:47,119
the day will break.

617
00:28:50,279 --> 00:28:51,079
Get up.

618
00:29:01,119 --> 00:29:01,920
Come on.

619
00:29:12,799 --> 00:29:14,400
Mom, I've learned this set of knife techniques.

620
00:29:14,680 --> 00:29:16,400
You are so smart.

621
00:29:16,720 --> 00:29:17,799
When you master it,

622
00:29:17,839 --> 00:29:18,880
I'll teach you a new one.

623
00:29:19,160 --> 00:29:20,160
How's it going?

624
00:29:29,720 --> 00:29:31,680
Mom, you got hurt again.

625
00:29:32,279 --> 00:29:33,160
It's nothing.

626
00:29:33,160 --> 00:29:34,599
Jiao, remember,

627
00:29:34,960 --> 00:29:36,200
in our Su's Escort Agency,

628
00:29:36,359 --> 00:29:37,400
we live with the escort.

629
00:29:37,920 --> 00:29:39,359
This little injury is nothing.

630
00:29:40,240 --> 00:29:41,720
Alright, don't just stand there.

631
00:29:41,720 --> 00:29:42,519
Go inside.

632
00:29:43,000 --> 00:29:43,720
Go.

633
00:29:55,559 --> 00:29:56,359
Mom,

634
00:29:56,720 --> 00:29:59,079
Jiao escorted goods with me today.

635
00:30:00,000 --> 00:30:00,680
Grandma,

636
00:30:00,680 --> 00:30:03,400
I want to be an escort as good as you.
